      "id": "round-heads-sahara-s042-p00417",
      "source_en": "Such similarities cannot be accidental since we never find them in the modern culture north of the Central Sahara. One of the main features of African culture in general is its conservatism. Comparative studies of the Round Head motifs with the art in the regions south of the Tassili, mainly Chad, Niger and Mali, may find similarities rooted possibly in the same artistic tradition.",
